.TH Path.is_directory 3 2026-09-01 "Tomo man-pages"
.SH NAME
Path.is_directory \- check if a path is a directory
.SH LIBRARY
Tomo Standard Library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.BI Path.is_directory\ :\ func(path:\ Path,\ follow_symlinks:\ Bool\ =\ yes\ ->\ Bool)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Checks if the path represents a directory. Optionally follows symbolic links.


.SH ARGUMENTS

.TS
allbox;
lb lb lbx lb
l l l l.
Name	Type	Description	Default
path	Path	The path to check. 	-
follow_symlinks	Bool	Whether to follow symbolic links. 	yes
.TE
.SH RETURN
`yes` if the path is a directory, otherwise `no`.

.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
assert (./directory/).is_directory()
assert not (./file.txt).is_directory()
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Tomo-Path (3)
